    "title": "Giants star Jung Hoo Lee briefly detained at Los Angeles International Airport - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Angelina Martin ,\n3 hours ago Giants outfielder Jung Hoo Lee was detained Wednesday evening at Los Angeles International Airport, his agent Scott Boras told the San Francisco Chronicle, before eventually being released. Boras told the Chronicle it was “just paper work” and that they were working to resolve the issue. Rep. Nancy Pelosi's office confirmed... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
